        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Admin as Admin\n    participant UI as Form Tambah\n    participant Sys as Sistem\n    participant DB as Database\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Memilih tambah fasilitas\n    UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Menampilkan form\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;UI: Mengisi data fasilitas &amp; Simpan\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Sys: Kirim data fasilitas baru\n    Sys-&gt;&gt;Sys: Melakukan validasi\n    \n    alt Data Valid (Normal Course)\n        Sys-&gt;&gt;DB: Menyimpan fasilitas ke database\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Sys: Data tersimpan\n        Sys--&gt;&gt;UI: Response sukses\n    else Data Belum Lengkap (Alternate A.1)\n        Sys--&gt;&gt;UI: Validasi gagal (Kosong)\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Menampilkan pesan kesalahan data belum lengkap\n    else Data Tidak Valid (Alternate A.2)\n        Sys--&gt;&gt;UI: Validasi gagal (Format salah)\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Admin: Meminta admin memperbaiki data\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="q51vt8ik_Ecy5ycA-IFO-1">
